{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34168","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 孤园寺 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 孤园寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮屠从西来，事者极梁武。\n岩幽与水曲，结构无遗土。\n穷山林干尽，竭海珠玑聚。\n况即侍从臣，敢爱烟波坞。\n幡条玉龙扣，殿角金虬舞。\n释子厌楼台，生人露风雨。\n今来四百载，像设藏云浦。\n轻鸽乱驯鸥，鸣钟和朝橹。\n庭蕉裂旗斾，野蔓差缨组。\n石上解空人，窗前听经虎。\n林虚叶如织，水净沙堪数。\n徧问得中天，归修释迦谱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}